[
  {
    "id": "a_b1_footprints",
    "place": "maze",
    "once": "game",
    "note": "A B1: 最後の墓守の足跡。リーネの頼みを思い出す",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "A single line of footprints runs through the damp earth, heading steadily downward.",
          "ja": "湿った土に、足跡が一筋だけ続いている。重い靴の跡が、迷わず下へ向かっている。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "\"My master went down with his lantern. ...Please, find him.\"",
          "ja": "「師匠は、角灯を持って下りていきました。……どうか、見つけてください」"
        },
        "speaker": {
          "en": "Riine",
          "ja": "リーネ"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "You remember Riine's words back in town.",
          "ja": "町で聞いたリーネの声を、思い出した。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "flag",
        "id": "a_b1_footprints"
      }
    ],
    "bgm": "audio/bgm/story.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a_b2_remains",
    "place": "maze",
    "once": "game",
    "note": "A B2: 最後の墓守の亡骸と手記。角灯が手に入る",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "A body in a warden's coat leans against the wall, clutching a lantern that still burns with a pale blue flame.",
          "ja": "墓守の外套をまとった亡骸が、壁にもたれている。胸に、青白い火の灯った角灯を抱えている。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "A journal lies beside him.",
          "ja": "そばに、手記が落ちていた。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "\"The seal has broken from within. The First Warden has woken.\nHe is not evil. He has simply held on too long.\nI will go down and bind it again. If I do not return, take this lantern to the sealing chamber.\"",
          "ja": "「封じが内側から破られた。最初の墓守が、目を覚ましたのだ。\nあれは悪ではない。長く守りすぎたのだ。\n私が下りて、結び直す。もし戻らなければ――この角灯を、封じの間へ」"
        },
        "speaker": {
          "en": "The Last Warden",
          "ja": "最後の墓守"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "give_item",
        "id": "masters_lantern"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "...The hand still feels warm. He did not end here. Only his spirit went on, further down.",
          "ja": "……亡骸の手は、まだ温かい気がした。この人は、ここで力尽きたのではない。魂だけが、さらに下へ向かったのだ。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "flag",
        "id": "a_found_remains"
      }
    ],
    "bgm": "audio/bgm/story.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a_b3_bell",
    "place": "maze",
    "once": "place",
    "note": "A B3: 弔いの鐘。鳴らすと奥の扉 (gate:a_bell) が開き、亡者が静まる",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "A rusted funeral bell hangs from the ceiling. Its rope is braided from bone.",
          "ja": "天井から、錆びた弔いの鐘が下がっている。綱は骨で編まれている。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "text": {
          "en": "Ring it?",
          "ja": "鳴らす？"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Ring the bell",
              "ja": "鳴らす"
            },
            "steps": [
              {
                "type": "sound",
                "id": "secret_found"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": {
                  "en": "A low toll spreads through the ossuary. The rustling of the bone walls falls silent for a moment.",
                  "ja": "ごおん……と、低い音が納骨堂に広がった。骨の壁のざわめきが、ひととき止んだ。"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "heal",
                "dice": "2d8"
              },
              {
                "type": "open",
                "id": "a_bell"
              },
              {
                "type": "flag",
                "id": "a_bell_rung"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Leave",
              "ja": "立ち去る"
            },
            "steps": [
              {
                "type": "again"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "a_b3_offerings",
    "place": "maze",
    "once": "game",
    "note": "A B3: 鐘の奥の供物",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "In the little room behind the bell, offerings left by mourners remain.",
          "ja": "鐘の奥の小部屋に、弔いに来た人々の供物が残っていた。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "sound",
        "id": "chest_open"
      },
      {
        "type": "treasure",
        "count": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "gold",
        "value": 150
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "a_b4_stele",
    "place": "maze",
    "once": "place",
    "note": "A B4: 歴代墓守の石碑。最初の墓守の名を答えると開く (gate:a_stele)",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "The names of every warden are carved into the stele. Only the topmost name is gone, as if scraped away by fingernails from the inside.",
          "ja": "石碑に、歴代の墓守の名が刻まれている。一番上の名だけが、内側から爪で掻いたように削れている。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "Below, in small letters: \"Speak the name of the First Warden. Only those who bear it may pass.\"",
          "ja": "下に小さく、こう刻んである。「最初の墓守の名を呼べ。その名を持つ者だけが、先へ進める」"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "if",
        "when": [
          {
            "type": "flag",
            "id": "a_priest_name"
          }
        ],
        "then": [
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "text": {
              "en": "Speak a name",
              "ja": "名を呼ぶ"
            },
            "options": [
              {
                "label": {
                  "en": "Ord",
                  "ja": "オルド"
                },
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "type": "sound",
                    "id": "secret_found"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                      "en": "The scraped name glows faintly. Behind the stele, a door unlatches.",
                      "ja": "削られた名の跡が、かすかに光った。石碑の奥で、扉の外れる音がした。"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "open",
                    "id": "a_stele"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "label": {
                  "en": "Elm",
                  "ja": "エルム"
                },
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "type": "sound",
                    "id": "trap"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                      "en": "The stele is cold and silent. A chill runs down your spine.",
                      "ja": "石碑は冷たく黙っている。背筋に悪寒が走った。"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "damage",
                    "dice": "2d6",
                    "damage_type": "necrotic"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "again"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "label": {
                  "en": "Vail",
                  "ja": "ヴァイル"
                },
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "type": "sound",
                    "id": "trap"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                      "en": "The stele is cold and silent. A chill runs down your spine.",
                      "ja": "石碑は冷たく黙っている。背筋に悪寒が走った。"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "damage",
                    "dice": "2d6",
                    "damage_type": "necrotic"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "again"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "label": {
                  "en": "Leave",
                  "ja": "立ち去る"
                },
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "type": "again"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "else": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "en": "You do not know the First Warden's name. Someone in town might.",
              "ja": "最初の墓守の名を、知らない。町の誰かが知っているかもしれない。"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "again"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
