          "en": "Behind the stele lie relics left by the wardens of old.",
          "ja": "石碑の奥には、歴代の墓守が遺した品が並べてあった。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "sound",
        "id": "chest_open"
      },
      {
        "type": "treasure",
        "count": 2
      },
      {
