      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "a_b5_seal",
    "place": "maze",
    "once": "place",
    "note": "A B5: 封じの扉。墓守の角灯で開く (gate:a_seal)",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "A door traced with pale blue sigils. At its center is a hook for a lantern.",
          "ja": "青白い紋様の走る扉がある。扉の真ん中に、角灯を掛ける鉤がある。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "if",
        "when": [
          {
            "type": "item",
            "id": "masters_lantern"
          }
        ],
        "then": [
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "text": {
              "en": "Hang the lantern?",
              "ja": "角灯を掛ける？"
            },
            "options": [
              {
                "label": {
                  "en": "Hang it",
                  "ja": "掛ける"
                },
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "type": "sound",
                    "id": "door"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                      "en": "The lantern's flame spreads into the sigils, and the door swings open without a sound.",
                      "ja": "角灯の火が扉の紋様へ燃え移り、扉は音もなく開いた。"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "open",
                    "id": "a_seal"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "label": {
                  "en": "Leave",
                  "ja": "立ち去る"
                },
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "type": "again"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "else": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "en": "You have nothing to hang there.",
              "ja": "掛けるものを持っていない。"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "again"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "a_b5_master",
    "place": "maze",
    "once": "game",
    "note": "A B5: 最後の墓守の魂。最期の言葉と祝福",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "Deep in the chamber stands a half-transparent warden, the same pale blue as the lantern's flame.",
          "ja": "封じの間の奥に、半ば透けた墓守が立っていた。角灯の火と同じ、青白い姿だった。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "\"You came. My binding broke halfway. The First Warden, Ord, lies below.\"",
          "ja": "「よく来てくれた。私の封じは、半ばで破れた。最初の墓守――オルドは、この下にいる」"
        },
        "speaker": {
          "en": "The Last Warden",
          "ja": "最後の墓守"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "\"Ord drove his own heart into the bottom of the spiral as a wedge, to hold back the Call that rises from below. For a thousand years he held it alone.\nHe held on so long that he and the Call became one. He is not a villain. Let him sleep.\nCarry his heart to the surface. ...And tell Riine I am sorry.\"",
          "ja": "「オルドは、自分の心臓を楔にして螺旋の底へ打ち込み、下から湧く『呼び声』を押さえた。千年、ひとりでだ。\n押さえすぎて、呼び声と混ざってしまった。悪人ではない。眠らせてやってくれ。\nその心臓を、地上へ持ち帰ってくれ。……リーネに、すまなかったと」"
        },
        "speaker": {
          "en": "The Last Warden",
          "ja": "最後の墓守"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "sound",
        "id": "heal"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "The warden's hand glows, and all your wounds close.",
          "ja": "墓守の手が光り、傷がすべて癒えた。"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heal"
      },
      {
        "type": "cure"
      },
      {
        "type": "xp",
        "value": 300
      },
      {
        "type": "flag",
        "id": "a_master_found"
      }
    ],
    "bgm": "audio/bgm/story.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a_riine",
    "place": "town",
    "title": {
      "en": "Riine, the Apprentice Warden",
      "ja": "墓守見習いのリーネ"
    },
    "note": "A: 物語の中心。進み具合で話が変わる",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "if",
        "when": [
          {
            "type": "flag",
            "id": "has_spiral_heart"
          }
        ],
        "then": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "en": "\"...Thank you. Now the spiral can rest.\"",
              "ja": "「……ありがとう。これで、螺旋は静かになります」"
            },
            "speaker": {
              "en": "Riine",
              "ja": "リーネ"
            }
          }
        ],
        "else": [
          {
            "type": "if",
            "when": [
              {
                "type": "flag",
                "id": "a_master_found"
              }
            ],
            "then": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": {
                  "en": "\"You... met my master?\"",
                  "ja": "「師匠に……会えたんですか」"
                },
                "speaker": {
                  "en": "Riine",
                  "ja": "リーネ"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": {
                  "en": "\"I see. 'I'm sorry'... How unfair of him.\"",
                  "ja": "「そうですか。すまなかった、なんて。……ずるい人です」"
                },
                "speaker": {
                  "en": "Riine",
                  "ja": "リーネ"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": {
                  "en": "\"Bring back the First Warden's heart. Then I will become the new warden.\"",
                  "ja": "「最初の墓守の心臓を、持ち帰ってください。そうしたら、私が新しい墓守になります」"
                },
                "speaker": {
                  "en": "Riine",
                  "ja": "リーネ"
                }
              }
            ],
            "else": [
              {
                "type": "if",
                "when": [
                  {
                    "type": "flag",
                    "id": "a_found_remains"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                      "en": "\"That lantern... it's my master's.\"",
                      "ja": "「その角灯……師匠のです」"
                    },
                    "speaker": {
                      "en": "Riine",
                      "ja": "リーネ"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                      "en": "\"It was beside his body? ...But I don't think it's over. He was heading for the Sealing Chambers.\"",
                      "ja": "「亡骸のそばにあったんですか。……でも、きっとまだ終わっていない。師匠は、封じの間を目指していたはずです」"
                    },
                    "speaker": {
                      "en": "Riine",
                      "ja": "リーネ"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "else": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                      "en": "A girl waits by the cemetery gate. Her warden's coat is far too big for her.",
                      "ja": "町外れの墓地の門の前で、少女が待っていた。墓守の外套は、体に合わないほど大きい。"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                      "en": "\"I'm Riine, an apprentice warden. My master went down into the spiral with his lantern, and he hasn't come back.\"",
                      "ja": "「墓守見習いのリーネです。師匠が、角灯を持って螺旋へ下りたまま、戻ってきません」"
                    },
                    "speaker": {
                      "en": "Riine",
                      "ja": "リーネ"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                      "en": "\"The dead began spilling out the night he went down. ...Please. Find him.\"",
                      "ja": "「螺旋の死者があふれ始めたのは、師匠が下りた夜からです。……お願いします。師匠を、見つけてください」"
                    },
                    "speaker": {
                      "en": "Riine",
                      "ja": "リーネ"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "bgm": "audio/bgm/story.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a_priest",
    "place": "town",
    "title": {
      "en": "The Old Priest",
      "ja": "寺院の老司祭"
    },
    "note": "A: 墓守の歴史。最初の墓守の名を教える(石碑の謎に要る)",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "\"The wardens? This town was built as a lid over the spiral tomb.\"",
          "ja": "「墓守のことかね。この町は、螺旋の墓所の蓋として建てられたのだよ」"
        },
        "speaker": {
          "en": "The Old Priest",
          "ja": "老司祭"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "if",
        "when": [
          {
            "type": "flag",
            "id": "a_found_remains"
          }
        ],
        "then": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "en": "\"Below, they say, stands a stele carved with every warden's name. The topmost has been worn away. That is the First Warden: Ord.\"",
              "ja": "「下には、歴代の墓守の名を刻んだ石碑があるそうだ。一番上の名は擦り切れておる。最初の墓守、オルドの名だ」"
            },
            "speaker": {
              "en": "The Old Priest",
              "ja": "老司祭"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "en": "\"Ord made his own heart the wedge that sealed the bottom of the spiral. Every warden since has bound the seal again from above. That is what a warden is.\"",
              "ja": "「オルドは、自分の心臓を楔にして、螺旋の底を封じた。それからの墓守は、上から封じを結び直してきた。それが墓守の務めだ」"
            },
            "speaker": {
              "en": "The Old Priest",
              "ja": "老司祭"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "flag",
            "id": "a_priest_name"
          }
        ],
        "else": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "en": "\"Generation after generation, the wardens sealed the dead ever deeper. The spiral is deep because they have sent off the dead for so long.\"",
              "ja": "「代々の墓守が、死者を下へ下へと封じてきた。螺旋が深いのは、それだけ長く死者を見送ってきたからだ」"
            },
            "speaker": {
              "en": "The Old Priest",
              "ja": "老司祭"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "en": "\"Come back when you learn what became of the last warden. I may have more to tell you.\"",
              "ja": "「最後の墓守の行方が知れたら、また来なさい。話せることがある」"
            },
            "speaker": {
              "en": "The Old Priest",
              "ja": "老司祭"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "bgm": "audio/bgm/story.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a_barkeep",
    "place": "town",
    "title": {
      "en": "Ask the Barkeep for Rumors",
      "ja": "酒場の主人に噂を聞く"
    },
    "note": "A: 噂(ランダム)。あとでユニーク装備の持ち主の噂も入れる",
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": {
          "en": "\"Rumors? I've got a drink's worth.\"",
          "ja": "「噂か？ 一杯ぶんの話ならあるぜ」"
        },
        "speaker": {
          "en": "The Barkeep",
          "ja": "酒場の主人"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "random",
        "options": [
          {
            "weight": 1,
            "steps": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": {
                  "en": "\"Folk say there's an old adventurer's remains in a dead end on the first level. Pay your respects, and maybe he left something.\"",
                  "ja": "「地下一階の行き止まりで、昔の冒険者の亡骸を見たって話だ。手を合わせりゃ、何か残してるかもな」"
                },
                "speaker": {
                  "en": "The Barkeep",
                  "ja": "酒場の主人"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "weight": 1,
            "steps": [
              {
